{"id":"629911594","kind":"article","title":"知识工作中常常需要解决搜索问题","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6qVhFVJs8KKtzNwmVDzyCyGBDdCbcX7KoSyr"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2023-05-17","updated":"2023-05-17","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":380,"keywords":["知识工作","搜索问题","专家思维","反馈机制","组块"],"summary":"作者把知识工作描述为循环搜索过程：提出备选方案、筛选，并根据观察或反馈调整方向。他推测，专家的优势在于更快生成适合当前领域的做法、排除低效路径并更新搜索策略；这可能与建立复杂的组块重编码机制有关。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/629911594","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"J_50ZmcK\">无论是设计软件界面，编写摄动人心的引言，还是诊断问题与不足——各种各样的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2eKzbL5nwQrm8Zr26rtaLHXyKHREr3tm5HbY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知识工作</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>都依赖于循环往复地想出可能，做出取舍，根据观察或者反馈继续搜索。</p><p data-pid=\"frKY96Yr\">就我个人的设计和工程经验而言，专家擅长的是编制出「领域」合适的办法，快速舍弃不太能奏效的办法，并根据观察或反馈更新他们搜索方针。有一个可能的解释：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7s7zpUDq2EEXnu3XJQLmqjddZnwGkBfz5WWL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专业水准需要建立复杂的组块重编码方案</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"jo04PKOK\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"467156331\" href=\"#/post/467156331\">专业需要建立复杂精细的组块重编码架构</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"puByJgKJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">Shom</span>、校对 JarrettYe<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6qVhFVJs8KKtzNwmVDzyCyGBDdCbcX7KoSyr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Knowledge work often requires solving search problems (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 知识工作 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"551580008\" href=\"#/post/551580008\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 专业水准需要建立复杂的组块重编码方案 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"467156331\" href=\"#/post/467156331\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"629646609","title":"Nielsen, M. A. (2004). 有效研究的原则（第 0404 则技术笔记）昆士兰大学","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":4,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"639517955","title":"吹捧数据，迷失意义","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":95,"minutes":11,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"467156331","title":"专业水准需要建立复杂的组块重编码方案","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"551580008","title":"知识工作","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":7,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}